# AWS Storage Services Benchmark v1.0.0
# 2.7 - Ensure creating IAM User

META
    esp_id `aws-stor-2-7`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `aws`
    criticality `medium`
    control_mapping `NIST-800-53:AC-2,NIST-800-53:RA-5,KSI:KSI-AFR-ADS,KSI:KSI-AFR-SCN`
    title `2.7 - Ensure creating IAM User`
    description `Verify ESP daemon IAM user exists in the /esp/ path with limited access keys.`
    author `example-security`
    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    impl_AC_2 `2.7: Ensure creating IAM User`
    impl_RA_5 `2.7: Ensure creating IAM User`
META_END

DEF
    OBJECT esp_daemon
        user_name `SCANNER_IAM_USER`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE esp_daemon_check
        found boolean = true
        access_key_count int <= 1
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN aws_iam_user
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF esp_daemon_check
            OBJECT_REF esp_daemon
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
